<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for Caraustar Industries Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Atlanta packaging company closed on Friday at 27.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
